{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop aboard your custom gravity-defying train and embark on a hectic quest to defeat the sinister Miraid\u014d corporation, alongside a vibrant pack of outcasts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/d5c517d62ae422e7e5ca4e7da7784f81.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/d5c517d62ae422e7e5ca4e7da7784f81.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/d5c517d62ae422e7e5ca4e7da7784f81.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ollie, kickflip, and grind your way through Japan's biggest cities, as well as a world of meadows, volcanoes and oceans.\u00a0Rack up points and chase that sweet high score as you flip, trick and stick the landing in your customisable ride.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/bddb139386ad7059c569e43d69438312.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/bddb139386ad7059c569e43d69438312.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/bddb139386ad7059c569e43d69438312.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a lineup of reimagined Japanese trains, gain the respect of an underground network of gangs and rebels, and turn rivals to allies as you master your skills.\u00a0Journey from naive beginner to seasoned pro as you strive to race the fastest train in existence and become a legendary Denshattacker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/a1644aaef0e8cd390546aae434c350fa.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/a1644aaef0e8cd390546aae434c350fa.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/a1644aaef0e8cd390546aae434c350fa.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mecha magical girls to moving castles, and mechanical worms to a Denshattacker army -- face a flurry of madcap bosses that get wilder and wilder the further you get. Use what you\u2019ve learned to stop them in their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/2918864efdb082a20086ab59b03fc4e6.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/2918864efdb082a20086ab59b03fc4e6.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/2918864efdb082a20086ab59b03fc4e6.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from the countryside of Kyushu through the metropolises of Osaka, Tokyo and more, now sealed under domes by Miraid\u014d.\u00a0Venture across Japan to the snowfields of Hokkaido... and beyond! Each new region holds fresh challenges to beat and rules to break.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2524850?t=1772549975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/42d8e707e2939d32d3f55ade053eb098a015c19b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772549975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/03fd4f8c99606d9c446804bb9475b4d2de12f2d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772549975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/03fd4f8c99606d9c446804bb9475b4d2de12f2d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772549975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4142750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/89f5a5d1281bec7c58ea627bd0fafb52.avif?t=1772549975\" width=800 height=224 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop aboard your custom gravity-defying train and embark on a hectic quest to defeat the sinister Miraid\u014d corporation, alongside a vibrant pack of outcasts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/d5c517d62ae422e7e5ca4e7da7784f81.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/d5c517d62ae422e7e5ca4e7da7784f81.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/d5c517d62ae422e7e5ca4e7da7784f81.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ollie, kickflip, and grind your way through Japan's biggest cities, as well as a world of meadows, volcanoes and oceans.\u00a0Rack up points and chase that sweet high score as you flip, trick and stick the landing in your customisable ride.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/bddb139386ad7059c569e43d69438312.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/bddb139386ad7059c569e43d69438312.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/bddb139386ad7059c569e43d69438312.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a lineup of reimagined Japanese trains, gain the respect of an underground network of gangs and rebels, and turn rivals to allies as you master your skills.\u00a0Journey from naive beginner to seasoned pro as you strive to race the fastest train in existence and become a legendary Denshattacker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/a1644aaef0e8cd390546aae434c350fa.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/a1644aaef0e8cd390546aae434c350fa.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/a1644aaef0e8cd390546aae434c350fa.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mecha magical girls to moving castles, and mechanical worms to a Denshattacker army -- face a flurry of madcap bosses that get wilder and wilder the further you get. Use what you\u2019ve learned to stop them in their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/2918864efdb082a20086ab59b03fc4e6.poster.avif?t=1772549975\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/2918864efdb082a20086ab59b03fc4e6.webm?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/extras/2918864efdb082a20086ab59b03fc4e6.mp4?t=1772549975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from the countryside of Kyushu through the metropolises of Osaka, Tokyo and more, now sealed under domes by Miraid\u014d.\u00a0Venture across Japan to the snowfields of Hokkaido... and beyond! Each new region holds fresh challenges to beat and rules to break.</p>","developers":["Undercoders"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524850/9e82089d034705eaa84ecb130d04ed1084ce574c/header.jpg?t=1772549975","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2524850/1364110270/63f1a6df1663d6697305d0ae9d76c999e6f22a25/1772548011/dash_av1.mpd?t=